  "sourceTitle": "Leftover Tabouli Salad Patties",
  "sourceText": "Leftover Tabouli Salad Patties\nBy: Thecoffeebreak\nPublished: Monday, May 24, 2010 - 2:42am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n100 grams quinoa tabouli salad or just cooked quinoa\n1 small egg\n4 tablespoons of flour\n1/2 teaspoon paprika\n1/2 teaspoon cumin\nOil for frying\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a bowl combine all ingredients; form 5 medium size patties. 2 Preheat frying pan, add oil. Fry each patty on both sides until golden brown.",
